{"about_the_game":"You're a duck. \ud83e\udd86 You have a pond.\ud83d\udca7 Life is great. \u2728<br>Except nosy visitors keep trying to come over to look at your pond and pet you! <br><br>Over your fallen feathers!<br><br>Territorial Duck is a cute 2D rogue-lite where you play as duck with sharing-difficulties.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100130/extras/chaseMini.jpg?t=1723375564\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chase away visitors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Strike terror</strong> into the hearts of any who would dare step close to your pond. <br></li><li><strong>Steal items</strong> to make your quacks more fearsome to any who visit.<br></li><li><strong>Create wild builds</strong> by carefully choosing which items to steal.<br></li><li><strong>Keep your sanity</strong> until you've chased away each person and animal.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100130/extras/buildMini.jpg?t=1723375564\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize your pond</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unlock</strong> furniture and fauna to decorate your pond.<br></li><li><strong>Gather</strong> materials to be able to build specific furniture.<br></li><li><strong>Expand</strong> your pond- and build-area.<br><br>Come over and save this poor duck and their home from nosy animals and people!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2100130?t=1723375564","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1723375564","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1723375564","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1723375564","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controlle